 sessions with personalized **augmented reality** scenarios tailored to your team's or company's needs.  \n- **Ease of Use**: Enjoy simple setup and an intuitive interface for effortless training.  \n- **Engagement and Safety**: Deliver effective training in a **risk-free environment**, boosting knowledge retention and confidence.  \n\n**FAST XR** is the ideal tool for anyone looking to improve their fire safety training. It combines advanced technology and innovative teaching methods to optimize preparedness for fire emergencies, ensuring maximum training effectiveness.\n\n# AVAILABLE LANGUAGES\n**FAST XR** is translated into 9 languages. (English, French, German, Dutch, Italian, Spanish, Swedish, Norwegian, Arabic, Portuguese)\n\n# LICENCE USE\nThe **FAST XR** application requires a mandatory commercial license for use, available at pro-xr.com.\n", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "Welcome to the future of fire safety training with **FAST XR**.\n\nOur revolutionary app combines **virtual and augmented** reality to create an immersive and interactive learning experience. Perfect for training organizations, businesses and even personal use, FAST XR puts users at the heart of controlled action, allowing them to master firefighting techniques without any risk.\n\n# MAIN FEATURES\n\n- **Realistic Scenarios**: Immerse yourself in various virtual environments where every decision counts.  \n- **Active Learning**: Learn by doing with interactive exercises designed for hands-on mastery.  \n- **Scenario Creation**: Customize training sessions with personalized **augmented reality** scenarios tailored to your team's or company's needs.  \n- **Ease of Use**: Enjoy simple setup and an intuitive interface for effortless training.  \n- **Engagement and Safety**: Deliver effective training in a **risk-free environment**, boosting knowledge retention and confidence.  \n\n**FAST XR** is the ideal tool for anyone looking to improve their fire safety training. It combines adva